        <mxCell id="leg" value="&lt;span style='font-size:11px;line-height:1.5'&gt;1  an alarm or event reaches the front door&lt;br&gt;2  it starts or joins an incident workflow&lt;br&gt;3  the zones pick up their steps&lt;br&gt;4  read the evidence (read-only role)&lt;br&gt;5  ask the model (redacted facts only)&lt;br&gt;6  report in Slack&lt;br&gt;7  a person approves the exact plan&lt;br&gt;8  apply once, check, undo if it failed&lt;br&gt;9  everything is recorded and signed&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#1F2933;fontSize=12;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
